@startuml
title 01  |  Catalog evidence refresh

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #37678C
  LifeLineBorderColor #A9BAC8
  ParticipantBorderColor #476782
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  ActorBorderColor #476782
  ActorBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  GroupBorderColor #91AAC0
  GroupBackgroundColor #F5F9FC
  NoteBorderColor #D7B766
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
}

actor Operator
boundary "Streamlit UI" as UI
control "Refresh controller" as Controller
control "Catalog service" as Catalog
entity "Approved source adapter" as Source
database "SQLite repository" as Store

Operator -> UI: Request known-variant refresh
UI -> Controller: Validate operator action
Controller -> Catalog: Refresh variant with run context
Catalog -> Store: Read approved source registry\nand dated local facts
Store --> Catalog: Source identity and prior evidence
Catalog -> Source: Fetch approved external ID
note right of Source
  HTTPS and allowlisted destination;
  validate redirects, bounds, and reuse.
end note
Source --> Catalog: Actual payload or source error

alt Valid mapped observations, no critical conflict
  Catalog -> Store: Validate and commit facts transactionally\nwith field provenance and version
  Store --> Catalog: Committed facts and refresh status
  Catalog --> Controller: Fresh facts with actual dates
else Source failure or unresolved critical conflict
  Catalog -> Store: Load last-valid local facts
  Store --> Catalog: Dated prior evidence
  Catalog --> Controller: Warning and eligibility limits
end

Controller --> UI: Actual outcome and source status
UI --> Operator: Show facts, dates, and warning if needed

note over Catalog, Store
  Manual permitted imports follow the same
  mapping, validation, and repository rules.
end note
@enduml
